# Node: equal.ByBuiltinRule.SqrtQuotient
# Run: LITEX_NEW_PIPELINE=1 litex -f examples/new_pipeline/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/sqrt_quotient.lit
# trust: WD of a/b in R+ and sqrt(b) in R* until quotient/sqrt WD is stronger.

have a R+
have b R+
trust b != 0
trust a / b $in R+
trust sqrt(b) $in R*
sqrt(a / b) = sqrt(a) / sqrt(b)
